  "reference": "2 Abakorinzo 2",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwa obusuubili. Kho omwene ndarakhwo omwoyo oburamwitsila khandi neshibeela ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba nimba nimubeelesia, niwina ousangaasia isie, habula oyo owa ndabeelesiye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndahandiika likhuwa lienelo, mbu olwa ndakhaba ninzitsile endeshe okhubeelesibwa nabeenabo abakhoyile okhuchila nindikhoya; nimwisiikanga mwesi, mbu okhwikhoya khwanje nikhwo okhwikhoya khweenywe mwesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mumatinyu nobusaalili obwomumwoyo ndamuhandiichila, nindila amasika amanji; shikali mbu inywe mana mubeelesibwe ta, habula mbu mumanye obuheeli bwanje shinga olwa buli obunji khwinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwonooni nalebe aleshelwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu undi naba niyachila eshibeela nishibaho, shiyambeelesia isie ta; ne (endeshe okhulikaliyia) yamubeelesiakhwo kata inywe mwesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukuumwi buno, obwafuchiililwa nobunji bwabandu, bumuhelile omundu oufwana ario; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bulaano mukhole lukano--mumuleshele nimumutinyisia, mbu aleshe okhumilishila mubunji bweshibeelashie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila nimusaaya mbu mumutinyisilie obuheeli bweenywe katong'ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi niko akachila nimuhandiichila, okhumuteema, emanye nimuba nimuli abahulili mumakhuwa kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne owa muba nimulesheele, siesi emuleshela endio; okhuba nimba nindesheele omundu likhuwa liosi, akeenako aka emulesheele, emulesheele khulweenywe, imbeli waKristo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Setani aleshe okhunyoola obwiyangu khwifwe; okhuba khumanyile tsiyemitsie shinga olwa tsili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo nali eTeroa--obuhendi, nobuhuli muKrito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa ndoola eTeroa khulwa injiili yaKristo, khandi olwa omuliango kwanzikushila muMwami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shindanyoola obusakulushi bwosi mumwoyo ta, shichila shindamunyoola Tito omwana weefwe tawe; ne ndaseebulana ninabo nirula ninzia eMakedonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne emuupila Nyasaye mbu orio, oukhwimililanga mumwikhoyo kwobuhuli muKristo, nalolosilia mwifwe eshiuya shiobumanyibwe buli handu hosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ifwe khuli eshiuya eshilayi shiaKristo khuNyasaye, mubeenabo abahonibungwa, khandi mubeenabo abatibanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khubakhabili, neshiuya shiobufu eshileera okhufwa; ne khubambeli balia, neshiuya shiobulamu eshileera obulamu. Ne niwina oukanyala ako kosi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila ifwe shikhuli shinga obunji bwabandu olwa bali, abahooni ababatsa belikhuwa liaNyasaye, ta; ne ifwe khuboola mushiilingoole akarula khuNyasaye, imbeli waNyasaye, muKristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
